280
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:15,200
Okay!

281
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:17,140
Let me see what else we can do to help here.

282
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:18,180
Yeah, thanks.

283
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:21,820
Heatstroke is no joke, and I don't want to be lame and pass out.

284
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:25,580
Okay, I found some... thing.

285
00:14:26,780 --> 00:14:27,380
That's it?

286
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:32,780
You just gonna stand there and watch me die?

287
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:34,880
Whoa!

288
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:35,680
Okay, my dude.

289
00:14:35,780 --> 00:14:36,820
I didn't say rip it off me.

290
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:37,480
Sit down.

291
00:14:37,820 --> 00:14:38,900
Just unzip it a little.

292
00:14:38,900 --> 00:14:41,260
Can we at least get you to the dressing room?

293
00:14:41,940 --> 00:14:42,060
Huh?

294
00:14:43,220 --> 00:14:43,700
Right.

295
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:44,960
I'm an idiot.

296
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,620
She said she can't move.

297
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:49,520
She does seem to be having a rough time.

298
00:14:53,560 --> 00:14:54,380
Here goes.

299
00:14:54,380 --> 00:14:59,940
This is no time to be panicking.

300
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:01,300
Please excuse me.

301
00:15:04,220 --> 00:15:04,700
Oh!

302
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:06,800
Holy crap!

303
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:09,680
Now I'm freezing because my back is dripping wet.

304
00:15:10,560 --> 00:15:10,900
Ugh!

305
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:13,160
Even my undies are drenched in sweat.

306
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:15,000
I seriously should have brought an extra pair.

307
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:15,900
Next time.

308
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:16,860
Hey, Gojo?

309
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,400
Could you wipe my back?

310
00:15:18,860 --> 00:15:19,460
Uh, sure.

311
00:15:20,660 --> 00:15:22,040
Stop panicking, dude!

312
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:24,960
Okay.

313
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:28,380
So, I'm gonna wipe now.

314
00:15:29,420 --> 00:15:29,800
Ugh!

315
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,120
Whoa!

316
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:34,680
Could you go a little lower?

317
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:36,420
I'm like a fountain, I swear.

318
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,300
L-lower?

319
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:40,460
You mean like...

320
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:40,720
here?

321
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:42,840
Yeah, there.

322
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:44,100
Right there.

323
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:45,160
Yes!

324
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:47,560
Oh, that feels so good!

325
00:15:48,460 --> 00:15:49,920
Oh, wow.

326
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:51,140
Yeah!

327
00:15:51,140 --> 00:15:51,300
Ah!

328
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:52,080
There!

329
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:52,860
More!

330
00:15:56,300 --> 00:15:59,000
Hey, Kitagawa, can you try to keep your voice down, please?

331
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:01,200
Someone's gonna hear you and come back here.

332
00:16:01,740 --> 00:16:03,180
No, they won't!

333
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:07,020
Besides, I'm not being that loud, and if I am, I'm not trying to, so whatever.

334
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:09,480
Oh, yeah.

335
00:16:12,060 --> 00:16:14,200
I'm pretty sure that I've got a swamp under here.

336
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:15,980
Gojo, could you hand me a towel?

337
00:16:16,380 --> 00:16:17,000
Put that down!

338
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:17,720
Someone might see!

339
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:19,180
Don't you worry about that.

340
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:20,440
I've got shorts on!

341
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:21,020
You do?

342
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,940
Oh, of course you do!

343
00:16:25,500 --> 00:16:26,460
Those look neat.

344
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:27,780
Did you write them out yourself?

345
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:28,760
I did!

346
00:16:29,100 --> 00:16:32,320
I figured if I want to be Shizuku-tan, I should probably go all out.

347
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:34,160
Huh, yeah, that's cool.

348
00:16:36,180 --> 00:16:38,220
Okay, this should help to reinforce it.

349
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:39,240
You're the best.

350
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:40,760
Be careful, though.

351
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,660
It's not as strong as a sewing machine stitch.

352
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:43,360
Mm-hmm.

353
00:16:43,780 --> 00:16:45,440
I think we should head home for now.

354
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:46,320
Good idea.

355
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:48,300
You seem pretty exhausted.

356
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:50,860
I'm so sorry, Gojo.

357
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,980
Could we go back to the plaza again?

358
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:54,360
It'll only take a second.

359
00:16:54,360 --> 00:17:02,780
Oh, hey there!

360
00:17:05,740 --> 00:17:06,840
Shizuku, you're back!

361
00:17:07,180 --> 00:17:08,760
Sorry for running off like that earlier.

362
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:11,100
I got dizzy from all this heat.

363
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:11,760
What?

364
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:12,560
That's terrible.

365
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:13,680
I'm so sorry.

366
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:16,640
I'm actually feeling much better now when heading home,

367
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:18,760
but I felt awful for bailing on you earlier.

368
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:20,460
So I wanted to finish the shoot.

369
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,740
Oh, you didn't have to do that.

370
00:17:23,020 --> 00:17:25,440
But if you don't mind, I'd love a shot in the shade.

371
00:17:25,620 --> 00:17:26,320
Maybe over here.

372
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:27,100
Of course!

373
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:31,940
Here we go.

374
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,360
Last photo of the day.

375
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:36,340
Could I get you to look at the camera, please?

376
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:55,620
Oh, crap.

377
00:17:56,740 --> 00:17:57,500
I'm sorry!

378
00:17:57,800 --> 00:17:58,840
I don't know what I was thinking.

379
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:00,200
I'm deleting them now.

380
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:01,440
Oh, I don't blame you.

381
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:02,520
You're right.

382
00:18:02,580 --> 00:18:04,020
I wasn't looking at the camera at all.

383
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:04,420
Sorry.

384
00:18:04,900 --> 00:18:05,180
What?

385
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:07,100
Okay, one more.

386
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:08,500
This time, I'll get it right.

387
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,820
That's what she's worried about?

388
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:20,140
I'm glad we found a seat.

389
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:22,220
Yeah, we're lucky it isn't crowded.

390
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:23,640
Thanks, Gojo.

391
00:18:23,940 --> 00:18:24,900
Great job today.

392
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:27,860
Man, I guess that means summer's here already.

393
00:18:28,560 --> 00:18:29,260
Looks like.

394
00:18:29,620 --> 00:18:32,420
I can't wait to jump into the shower as soon as I get home.

395
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:35,080
Kitagawa?

396
00:18:35,580 --> 00:18:35,840
Huh?

397
00:18:37,140 --> 00:18:38,360
Thank you for everything.

398
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:40,960
I know it was rough at times,

399
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:42,960
but this was a great experience.

400
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:46,540
And I...

401
00:18:46,540 --> 00:18:48,120
I really had fun with you.

402
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,060
I did too.

403
00:18:51,940 --> 00:18:53,520
So much fun with you.

404
00:18:54,220 --> 00:18:54,960
Thanks, Gojo.

405
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,060
You rule.

406
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:09,220
So what are we gonna do for the next one?

407
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:10,660
Next one?

408
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:11,840
My next cosplay.

409
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:12,680
Huh?

410
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:14,700
Uh, so...

411
00:19:14,700 --> 00:19:15,700
You...

412
00:19:15,700 --> 00:19:17,760
You wanna be more than just Shizuku-tan?

413
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:19,100
Is that a serious question?

414
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:21,760
OMG, I have like 50 all-time fave characters!

415
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,840
What's the point of favorites, then?

416
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:25,360
This is such a hard decision.

417
00:19:25,580 --> 00:19:28,340
I mean, I still wanna cosplay the heck out of Shizuku-tan.

418
00:19:28,580 --> 00:19:31,060
But like, there are so many cosplays I wanna do,

419
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:33,280
and I only have one body to work with.

420
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:35,900
What's that face about?

421
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:38,660
Aw, look at that shy smile.

422
00:19:38,820 --> 00:19:41,240
You know, I think you might be happier than you let on.

423
00:19:41,620 --> 00:19:44,680
Uh, no, I, uh, I was just thinking about something.

424
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:45,520
Oh, yeah?

425
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:46,280
What?

426
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:47,420
Out with it.

427
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:50,140
Well, you know, it's...

428
00:19:50,140 --> 00:19:54,140
Um, I know I'm not great yet,

429
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:56,480
but I'm looking forward to working with you again.

430
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:06,740
Mm-hmm, for sure.

431
00:20:07,380 --> 00:20:08,440
We need a dress form.

432
00:20:08,700 --> 00:20:09,600
I'm gonna go buy one.

433
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:11,760
It was kinda rough just winging it.

434
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:13,380
That sounds like a great idea.

435
00:20:13,660 --> 00:20:14,920
Actually, I'll buy it for you.

436
00:20:15,220 --> 00:20:17,020
I wonder if we can get one online.

437
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:21,820
Sweet, found one.

438
00:20:22,460 --> 00:20:23,680
Here, check this guy out.

439
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:28,980
Looks like someone needs a nap.

440
00:20:29,140 --> 00:20:29,780
Sleepy much?

441
00:20:30,320 --> 00:20:31,600
Oh, yeah, I'm sorry.

442
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:32,740
Guess I'm pretty wiped.

443
00:20:35,040 --> 00:20:36,700
I had so much fun, Gojo.

444
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:38,140
Thanks for an amazing day.

445
00:20:38,620 --> 00:20:41,160
Actually, it seemed like everyone was having fun.

446
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:42,140
It was so insane.

447
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:44,780
All those people together in one spot,

448
00:20:45,040 --> 00:20:46,040
doing what they loved.

449
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:47,860
The vibe was so hype.

450
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:49,240
I just ate it up.

451
00:20:50,060 --> 00:20:51,360
That's my favorite thing.

452
00:20:51,540 --> 00:20:53,500
Whether it's a hobby or a job or whatever,

453
00:20:53,760 --> 00:20:56,760
I love being around people having fun doing what they love.

454
00:20:57,360 --> 00:20:59,020
I can almost see them sparkle.

455
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:02,880
I can't wait to go to more events.

456
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:06,500
Holy crap, I didn't even take any pics with the other cosplayers.

457
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:08,580
I'm gonna go full paparazzi next time.

458
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:09,680
Like that Leo.

459
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:12,420
That was one cosplay I would have loved to have a shot with.

460
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:14,360
Leo from Seven BFs is so money.

461
00:21:14,940 --> 00:21:17,080
How are they all so beautiful without a filter?

462
00:21:17,340 --> 00:21:18,280
It's not fair.

463
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:19,500
You're right.

464
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:23,240
Kitagawa.

465
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:26,200
You looked so beautiful today.

466
00:21:31,700 --> 00:21:33,040
No other word since then

467
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:36,260
could define the things most precious to me.

468
00:21:37,020 --> 00:21:39,020
So I don't say beautiful or pretty

469
00:21:39,020 --> 00:21:40,940
unless it comes from the heart.

470
00:21:40,940 --> 00:21:58,100
you

471
00:21:58,100 --> 00:22:00,220
Huh...

472
00:22:28,100 --> 00:22:33,600
イタズラその一言つきゅんできたの

473
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:39,700
Ah これ以上期待しちゃだめ

474
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:45,700
今は二人で夢追いかけて

475
00:22:46,300 --> 00:22:50,400
ピュワピュワ一途なハートが

476
00:22:50,500 --> 00:22:53,200
ふわふわふわふわ

477
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:57,020
I can't believe it, but I can't believe it

478
00:22:57,020 --> 00:22:59,960
I can't believe it, too

479
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:04,380
I'll be honest with you

480
00:23:04,380 --> 00:23:06,860
So, please, please

481
00:23:06,860 --> 00:23:09,160
I can't believe it, too

482
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:11,100
I can't believe it, too

483
00:23:11,100 --> 00:23:15,000
I can't believe it, too

484
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:17,820
Na na na na na na na

485
00:23:17,820 --> 00:23:36,240
Next time

